 * NOTE: This file is generated by cmake/generate_version.cmake on every build,
 * but it carries nothing that changes with the commit: the commit is read at
 * runtime from the manifest beside the binary. Do not edit manually.
 *
 * Nothing build-specific may be substituted into this file. A string here that
 * changed per commit would recompile this translation unit and relink every
 * target that links ores.utility, which is exactly what the manifest avoids.
